§ `ss 13(3), 14 -- does Part 3 apply`

`a phone failing in May after January delivery` MEANS `My goods` WITH
    `the seller has shown that I did not deal as consumer` IS FALSE
    `it is a sale or transfer of goods or a hire-purchase agreement` IS TRUE
    `the date the contract was made` IS (DATE_FROM_DMY 10 1 2026)
    `the date the goods were delivered` IS (DATE_FROM_DMY 10 1 2026)
    `the goods are shown not to have conformed at delivery` IS FALSE
    `the date a lack of conformity was found` IS (JUST (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 5 2026))
    `it is established that the goods conformed at delivery` IS FALSE
    `the court finds the 6-month rule incompatible with the goods or the defect` IS FALSE

