§ `ss 15, 16 -- the remedies`

`nothing yet asked` MEANS `The remedies` WITH
    `repair is impossible` IS FALSE
    `replacement is impossible` IS FALSE
    `repair is disproportionate to replacement` IS FALSE
    `replacement is disproportionate to repair` IS FALSE
    `repair is disproportionate to a reduction or rescission` IS FALSE
    `replacement is disproportionate to a reduction or rescission` IS FALSE
    `I have required repair or replacement` IS FALSE
    `the seller failed to do it in a reasonable time without significant inconvenience to me` IS FALSE
    `the seller has had a reasonable time to do it` IS FALSE

`neither repair nor replacement possible` MEANS `The remedies` WITH
    `repair is impossible` IS TRUE
    `replacement is impossible` IS TRUE
    `repair is disproportionate to replacement` IS FALSE
    `replacement is disproportionate to repair` IS FALSE
    `repair is disproportionate to a reduction or rescission` IS FALSE
    `replacement is disproportionate to a reduction or rescission` IS FALSE
    `I have required repair or replacement` IS FALSE
    `the seller failed to do it in a reasonable time without significant inconvenience to me` IS FALSE
    `the seller has had a reasonable time to do it` IS FALSE

`a repair asked for and botched` MEANS `The remedies` WITH
    `repair is impossible` IS FALSE
    `replacement is impossible` IS FALSE
    `repair is disproportionate to replacement` IS FALSE
    `replacement is disproportionate to repair` IS FALSE
    `repair is disproportionate to a reduction or rescission` IS FALSE
    `replacement is disproportionate to a reduction or rescission` IS FALSE
    `I have required repair or replacement` IS TRUE
    `the seller failed to do it in a reasonable time without significant inconvenience to me` IS TRUE
    `the seller has had a reasonable time to do it` IS FALSE

`a repair asked for last week` MEANS `The remedies` WITH
    `repair is impossible` IS FALSE
    `replacement is impossible` IS FALSE
    `repair is disproportionate to replacement` IS FALSE
    `replacement is disproportionate to repair` IS FALSE
    `repair is disproportionate to a reduction or rescission` IS FALSE
    `replacement is disproportionate to a reduction or rescission` IS FALSE
    `I have required repair or replacement` IS TRUE
    `the seller failed to do it in a reasonable time without significant inconvenience to me` IS FALSE
    `the seller has had a reasonable time to do it` IS FALSE

`a repair asked for months ago` MEANS `The remedies` WITH
    `repair is impossible` IS FALSE
    `replacement is impossible` IS FALSE
    `repair is disproportionate to replacement` IS FALSE
    `replacement is disproportionate to repair` IS FALSE
    `repair is disproportionate to a reduction or rescission` IS FALSE
    `replacement is disproportionate to a reduction or rescission` IS FALSE
    `I have required repair or replacement` IS TRUE
    `the seller failed to do it in a reasonable time without significant inconvenience to me` IS FALSE
    `the seller has had a reasonable time to do it` IS TRUE

#ASSERT `May I require the seller to repair the goods` `a phone failing in May after January delivery` `nothing yet asked`

#ASSERT NOT `May I ask for a price reduction or rescind the contract` `a phone failing in May after January delivery` `nothing yet asked`
#ASSERT `May I ask for a price reduction or rescind the contract` `a phone failing in May after January delivery` `neither repair nor replacement possible`
#ASSERT `May I ask for a price reduction or rescind the contract` `a phone failing in May after January delivery` `a repair asked for and botched`

#ASSERT `Must the seller bear the cost of the repair or replacement` `a phone failing in May after January delivery` `a repair asked for last week`

#ASSERT `Can my refund be reduced for my use of the goods` TRUE TRUE

